{"chapter_id":"main-quest-71036","main_id":71036,"main_title":"勇气的余晖","main_description":"虽然层岩之下的事件已经暂时平息，但是志琼似乎还在进行其他的勘测工作，去问问她的情况吧…","chapter_title":"勇气的余晖","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":1,"subquest_id":7103604,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7103604,"sequence":16,"variant":0,"line_id":710360425,"next_line_ids":[710360426],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":20523,"speaker_text_hash":898809104,"speaker":"志琼","speaker_raw":"志琼","text_hash":59802466,"text":"嗯…你有这样想过吗，前辈…？","raw_text":"嗯…你有这样想过吗，前辈…？","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7103604.json"}
